1
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,260
Ah!

2
00:00:39,230 --> 00:00:40,130
Wait.

3
00:00:40,130 --> 00:00:41,600
Who are you?

4
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:45,700
Miss.

5
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:46,930
The Lord...

6
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:49,420
He was taken by the Heavenly Emperor.

7
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:53,030
What did you say?

8
00:00:53,930 --> 00:00:55,260
Who was taken?

9
00:00:55,730 --> 00:00:56,930
Demon Lord Cangyuan.

10
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,860
Heavenly Emperor Zhao Han led an army to attack the Demon Realm,

11
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,060
demanding the Lord hand you over.

12
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,200
The Lord's spiritual power hasn't recovered yet,

13
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,230
but he fought hard for a long time,

14
00:01:02,230 --> 00:01:03,300
killing two heavenly generals.

15
00:01:03,300 --> 00:01:03,930
In the end...

16
00:01:03,930 --> 00:01:05,730
He was struck down from the clouds by the Heavenly Emperor himself

17
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:07,200
and locked in the Heavenly Prison.

18
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:08,460
If you don't take action,

19
00:01:08,460 --> 00:01:10,060
the Lord will lose his life.

20
00:01:21,130 --> 00:01:22,430
Heavenly Emperor...

21
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:23,730
Zhao Han.

22
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:25,030
God of War Baili.

23
00:01:25,030 --> 00:01:26,130
Please save the Lord.

24
00:01:26,130 --> 00:01:27,630
In the Three Realms and Six Paths, only you

25
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:29,600
can save someone from the Heavenly Prison.

26
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,230
Three hundred years ago, when you guarded the South Heaven Gate,

27
00:01:31,230 --> 00:01:33,430
an army of a hundred thousand demons didn't dare to cross the line.

28
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:34,560
These years, the Lord has been guarding you,

29
00:01:34,560 --> 00:01:35,759
just afraid that you would feel sad thinking about the past.

30
00:01:35,759 --> 00:01:36,360
But now...

31
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,530
Now, really only you can save him.

32
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:39,759
What did you call me?

33
00:01:39,759 --> 00:01:40,630
God of War.

34
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:43,600
You are the God of War Baili of the Heaven Realm.

35
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:44,729
The number one God of War in the Six Realms.

36
00:01:44,729 --> 00:01:45,729
Back then, you...

37
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,600
I see.

38
00:01:57,259 --> 00:02:00,030
All the inexplicable doubts are finally clear.

39
00:02:00,730 --> 00:02:01,530
Cangyuan,

40
00:02:02,030 --> 00:02:04,230
so what you've been trying so hard to hide

41
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:05,800
is such a big secret.

42
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:21,930
Get up.

43
00:02:21,930 --> 00:02:22,730
Speak slowly.

44
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,630
Where is the Heavenly Prison?

45
00:02:23,630 --> 00:02:24,700
How many guards are there?

46
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:25,900
How is Cangyuan's condition now?

47
00:02:25,900 --> 00:02:27,260
Tell me everything in detail.

48
00:02:27,260 --> 00:02:28,130
Miss Baili.

49
00:02:28,530 --> 00:02:28,930
You...

50
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:30,760
You are willing to save the Lord?

51
00:02:33,030 --> 00:02:34,760
He was caught to protect me.

52
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,300
There's no reason for me not to go.

53
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:38,060
When I rescue him from the prison,

54
00:02:38,060 --> 00:02:40,920
I'll settle this score of him hiding things from me.

55
00:02:53,130 --> 00:02:53,860
Miss Baili.

56
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:54,960
Absolutely not.

57
00:02:55,230 --> 00:02:56,700
The South Heaven Gate is the main gate of the Heavenly Court,

58
00:02:56,700 --> 00:02:57,800
with the strictest guards.

59
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,030
If you go alone,

60
00:02:59,230 --> 00:03:00,630
once Zhao Han turns hostile,

61
00:03:00,630 --> 00:03:02,200
you won't even have a way out.

62
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:02,800
Yes.

63
00:03:03,230 --> 00:03:05,060
If anyone goes, we should be the ones charging in front.

64
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:06,630
How can we let you be the bait?

65
00:03:06,630 --> 00:03:07,760
It's too dangerous.

66
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,030
Precisely because the guards are strict,

67
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:15,300
it's worth me going.

68
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,930
Since Zhao Han wants Cangyuan to hand me over,

69
00:03:17,930 --> 00:03:20,030
it means his target has always been only me.

70
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:21,060
As long as I appear at the South Heaven Gate,

71
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:22,060
But your divine power hasn't recovered.

72
00:03:22,060 --> 00:03:23,460
What if Zhao Han attacks on the spot?

73
00:03:23,460 --> 00:03:24,790
he will lower his guard.

74
00:03:25,260 --> 00:03:26,430
Say no more.

75
00:03:31,530 --> 00:03:32,300
Cangyuan...

76
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,090
Cangyuan has protected me for so long.

77
00:03:35,530 --> 00:03:37,200
It's my turn to protect him.

78
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:38,700
Split into two teams

79
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:40,460
and sneak in through the West Heaven Gate's secret passage.

80
00:03:40,460 --> 00:03:42,260
The West Heaven Gate has fewer guards.

81
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:43,600
The bigger the commotion I make at the South Heaven Gate,

82
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,600
the emptier it will be over there.

83
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:46,060
You only have one goal:

84
00:03:46,130 --> 00:03:47,200
take advantage of the lack of guards

85
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:48,600
and get Cangyuan out of the Sky Prison.

86
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,800
But what if the Lord finds out?

87
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:50,930
This is the only way.

88
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,100
If we force our way in,

89
00:03:52,100 --> 00:03:54,300
we wouldn't stand a chance against the heavenly soldiers.

90
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:54,960
If we drag this out,

91
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:57,100
Cangyuan won't last three days in the Sky Prison.

92
00:03:57,100 --> 00:03:58,130
I can only act as bait

93
00:03:58,130 --> 00:03:59,060
while you save him.

94
00:03:59,060 --> 00:04:00,320
Do you all understand?

95
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,100
Understood.

96
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:07,960
Remember,

97
00:04:08,860 --> 00:04:10,060
make it quick.

98
00:04:18,459 --> 00:04:19,529
People from the lower realm,

99
00:04:19,529 --> 00:04:20,760
you are trespassing in the forbidden grounds of the Heavenly Court.

100
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,019
Retreat immediately.

101
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,600
I'm not here to trespass.

102
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,560
Go inform your Heavenly Emperor.

103
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,560
Tell him Bai Li is here

104
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,690
and wants to see him.

105
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:28,800
It's the God of War.

106
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,130
It's the Lord God of War.

107
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:30,730
What?

108
00:04:31,100 --> 00:04:32,560
The Lord God of War is back?

109
00:04:39,060 --> 00:04:40,530
I was wondering who it was.

110
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,900
So it's you.

111
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:42,930
Why?

112
00:04:43,130 --> 00:04:44,700
Couldn't stay in the Demon Realm anymore

113
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:46,560
and finally decided to come back?

114
00:04:46,630 --> 00:04:47,730
I'm not returning.

115
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,730
I'm here to pick someone up.

116
00:04:50,130 --> 00:04:51,860
Cangyuan is in your Sky Prison.

117
00:04:51,860 --> 00:04:52,600
Let him go.

118
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:54,990
Pick someone up?

119
00:04:55,930 --> 00:04:56,730
Bai Li,

120
00:04:57,300 --> 00:04:59,230
you have lost all your divine bones

121
00:04:59,630 --> 00:05:01,230
and your spiritual power is weak.

122
00:05:01,230 --> 00:05:03,630
Standing alone at my South Heaven Gate,

123
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,920
what right do you have to demand someone from me?

124
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,060
I'm here to demand my man.

125
00:05:13,630 --> 00:05:15,360
It's perfectly justified.

126
00:05:19,630 --> 00:05:21,690
Your Majesty doesn't dare to answer.

127
00:05:22,630 --> 00:05:23,300
What?

128
00:05:23,930 --> 00:05:25,600
Your Majesty doesn't dare to answer.

129
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,100
Are you afraid I'll actually rescue him

130
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:28,960
and make your Heavenly Court lose face?

131
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:29,900
Or is it that

132
00:05:29,900 --> 00:05:31,600
you, the dignified Heavenly Emperor,

133
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:33,400
to deal with a heavily injured Demon Lord,

134
00:05:33,400 --> 00:05:34,900
must rely on a siege by heavy troops

135
00:05:34,900 --> 00:05:35,760
to feel at ease?
